
beat Main
  new state
    gem: "opal"

  beat Vault
    The vault holds $gem.
    choice
      Take it
        You take the $gem.
      Leave it
        You leave the $gem.

  ref = Vault
  -> Town

beat Town
  In town.
  beat(ref)
  Back in town.

